      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "External registry — the role's contract",
      "prov:value": "`external-registry` in `scenarios/roles.json` is played by an **external**\nactor: trusted registries and observatories outside this instance's control.\nA role played by something we do not run is still a role, and its skills are\nits **contract**: what we rely on it to do (owner, 2026-10-16). It used to say\nit carried no skills \"because nothing here instructs it\"; a contract is not an\ninstruction, it is what the diagrams assume.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-16"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-16"
      ]
    }
  ]
